This is a almost at the limit : 

 ./xmand 32768 35184372088832 -6.3378386963316991e-02 +9.7988834095918365e-01 8

FP64 only allows for 53 bits of data and we use that a lot. So a large magnify
parameter will result in blocky looking strange results on screen.


Also eye of the red dragon : 

